{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-6","kind":"proposition","title":"两圆内相切必不同心","englishTitle":"If two circles touch one another, they will not have the same centre.","book":3,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","contentId":"euclid-3-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c3581b17af8aa488e6e20d999c205c83a9435a22d5b323e9e75d141c33e6d80","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-6.statement","euclid-3-6.construction.1","euclid-3-6.proof.1","euclid-3-6.proof.2","euclid-3-6.proof.3","euclid-3-6.proof.4","euclid-3-6.proof.5","euclid-3-6.conclusion","euclid-3-6.historical.1","euclid-3-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b23642ac6107d09693a28403d79667e4b52e26cd6d8d45915516b4d1b534b8f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two circles touch one another, they will not have the same centre."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个圆圈互相接触,它们就不会有相同的中心。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两圜内相切必不同心"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个内切圆的圆心必须不同"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"506022003e392a79c6c51b0a9b19e7217280ab68ea7f73a1bb3a9695d8c3604c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two circles ABC, CDE touch one another at the point C; I say that they will not have the same centre."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为让这两个圈子在C点相互接触ABC,CDE;我说,它们将没有相同的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c73205a195624f34a8f917057cefcd06f83f0672c74750aa68419a3ccbba6f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be F; let FC be joined, and let FEB be drawn through at random."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,让它为F;让FC连接,让FEB随机通过。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36c1a5353537d2230ef967281e32c79bd92cec1366649fb4f4e7c6bf46210d6b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the point F is the centre of the circle ABC, FC is equal to FB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"F点是ABC点的中心,FC等于FB点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fdcd622aa4bfa8eff9c25decacc13e776c4bca10f10e7d3498c09a11538edc88","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the point F is the centre of the circle CDE, FC is equal to FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于F点是CDE点的中心,FC点等于FE点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03dfc71ea900cee54700c97a2529b1444442ca6e77f06842a085846b18919141","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FC was proved equal to FB; therefore FE is also equal to FB, the less to the greater: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FC 被证明等于 FB; 因此, FE 也等于 FB, 数量小于 较大数量: 这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"171997da8af2ae771642d89049034f6b18b20de9b0a05d7ba1c7224a527c23a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore F is not the centre of the circles ABC, CDE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,F不是圈的中心,ABC,CDE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"844f89d3ba7481d6ff571fda37e7d8ab91f20ff6905f699e875e97ac6c44c0b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两圜内相切必不同心解曰甲乙丙乙两圜内相切于乙题言两圜不同心论曰若言丁为同心令自丁至乙至丙各作直线其丁乙至切界而丁丙截两圜之界于甲于丙夫丁既为甲乙圜之心则丁乙与丁甲等而又为丙乙圜之心则丁乙与丁丙又等是丁甲与丁丙亦等而全与其分等也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个内切圆的圆心不得同心。解释如下：甲乙丙乙 两个圆在乙处相切。命题解释：两个圆不共心。证明如下：如果丁是同心圆，并从丁到乙到丙画一条直线，丁乙到切线边界，同时丁丙在两个圆的边界处于甲和丙相交。由于丁是圆甲乙的中心，则丁乙和丁甲相等，丙乙是圆的中心。则丁乙和丁丙也相等，所以丁甲和丁丙也相等，且所有分割部分都相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-6.source","contentId":"euclid-3-6","revisionId":"euclid-3-6@raw-2c3581b17af8aa48","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbb9329dd48411f7bea3a4209d02823819e69c1e1e61afef43e9a2633e6e2b44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
